OL,3,GNEWSAHow student went from YouTube to
OL,4,ABake Off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student taking part in the new series
OL,7,Fof the Great British Bake Off says he
OL,8,Ftaught himself to bake after "stumbling
OL,9,Facross a YouTube video".
OL,11,FWhen Mo Mahir, 22, from West Bromwich,
OL,12,Fwas nine years old, he "found a video
OL,13,Fof a guy making a mug cake in a
OL,14,Fmicrowave", which he said ignited his
OL,15,Fpassion for baking.
OL,17,F"I feel like as a Bengali, we don't
OL,18,Freally have a lot of cakes or baking in
OL,19,Four cultural background. It started
OL,20,Fwith me mixing a bunch of random stuff.
OL,21,FMy mum used to always be shouting at me
OL,22,Fsaying, 'stop, that's making a mess'."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
